# Two devices (Mac Mini + cloud/mobile) can both append a log entry around
# the same time. For these append-only logs, git's union driver combines
# both sides' new lines instead of raising a merge conflict. Do NOT add
# profile-and-targets.md here: it's edited in place, not appended to, so a
# real conflicting edit there should still stop and ask rather than being
# silently unioned.
food-log.md merge=union
spending-log.md merge=union
grocery-purchases.md merge=union
exercise-log.md merge=union

# Binary files: never text-diff or text-merge these.
*.xlsx binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
